{#- Sponsor page: what sponsors get, as a pass in the same ticket shape as the "Next up" ticket. No blank lines: Markdown includes this -#}
<div class="ticket-wrap sponsor-pass" data-reveal>
  <article class="ticket">
    <div class="ticket-main">
      <span class="ticket-status">Sponsor pass</span>
      <h3 class="ticket-title">What sponsors get</h3>
      <ul class="ticket-meta pass-perks">
        <li><i class="ph ph-megaphone"></i><span><strong>A thank-you on stage</strong> at the start and end, and a few minutes to talk about your team.</span></li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-image"></i><span><strong>Your logo where it counts</strong>: the event page, the slides, the recap post and the sponsor list on this site.</span></li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-briefcase"></i><span><strong>The hiring and pitching session</strong> at the end of most meetups, to talk about roles you're hiring for.</span></li>
        <li><i class="ph ph-presentation-chart"></i><span><strong>A shot at the stage</strong>: your engineers can propose a talk through the same open review as everyone else.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <a href="{{ site.discussions }}" class="btn-navy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Talk to us <i class="ph ph-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
    </div>
    <div class="ticket-stub" aria-label="Every third Saturday">
      <span>EVERY</span>
      <strong>3rd</strong>
      <span>SAT</span>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>
